    "detailed_description": "Overrun is a extremely hard, arcade twin-stick shooter. Fight your way through waves of enemies, but try not to get overrun. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/f6ce729c3887b1dfb84be0d85931f742.poster.avif?t=1584870706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/f6ce729c3887b1dfb84be0d85931f742.webm?t=1584870706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/f6ce729c3887b1dfb84be0d85931f742.mp4?t=1584870706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade-style gameplay with unlimited waves of enemies<br></li><li>Randomly spawned enemies increasing in difficulty<br></li><li>Gain extra health and coins after completing each wave<br></li><li>Unlock new and unique weapons<br></li><li>Mix and match dozens of weapon combinations to suit your own playstyle<br></li><li>Upgrade existing weapons to give you the upper hand</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/dde518f177f6ca52f381d346691cd1ee.poster.avif?t=1584870706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/dde518f177f6ca52f381d346691cd1ee.webm?t=1584870706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1184070/extras/dde518f177f6ca52f381d346691cd1ee.mp4?t=1584870706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXTRAS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam cloud saving<br></li><li>Steam stats and achievements<br></li><li>Chiptune style music</li></ul>",
